# Complyete V1 architecture and implementation plan

## 1. Delivery target and architecture

Deliver a staff-only prototype for **November 18, 8PM Eastern**, prioritizing reminders, configurable task presets, project documents, and the client directory. Include projects, tasks, and the call log as supporting workflows.

Your latest answers expand V1 to include **configurable intake fields in presets**. Client accounts, maps, calendars, billing, time tracking, and electronic signature collection remain excluded.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    Staff[ESE staff browser] --> App[Next.js app on Cloudflare Workers]
    App --> Auth[Supabase Auth]
    App --> DB[PostgreSQL with staff access policies]
    Staff --> Storage[Private Supabase Storage]
    App --> Storage
    Cron[Supabase Cron] --> Job[Reminder Edge Function]
    Job --> DB
